## Interface: 16001, 11509
## Title: WoWBoxer
## Notes: Multiboxing in the game: squad setup, talents, recommended macros and sequence keys per level, action bars, settings and addon checks. One key press = one action on one character.
## Author: WoWBoxer (WoW-Multiboxing)
## Version: @project-version@
